    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39540" root="نخت" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَتَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْتٌ</span>, <i>He pecked,</i> or <i>picked
up, and pulled off,</i> or <i>tore off, and snatched away,
with his beak;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَرَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَتَخَ</span>, (K,) formed by
transposition. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَتَ</span>, [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخُتَ</span></b> ,] inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْتٌ</span>, <i>He took a date,</i> or <i>two dates, from a bag</i>
or <i>other receptacle for travelling-provisions &amp;c.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَتَ</span>, [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخُتَ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْتٌ</span>, <i>He plucked
out;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَتَفَ</span>. (IAth, L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See 2.

